000001-24D5-21E3-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description Status:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000005-1F81-CE0B-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-1F81-CE0B-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-5835-1C78-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-27A2-9E44-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The RBT Supervisor is responsible for overseeing the complete employment life cycle of Registered Behavior Technicians (RBTs), from recruitment coordination and onboarding through training, supervision, performance management, professional development, retention, and offboarding. This position serves as a primary point of contact and support for RBTs, ensuring that employees receive the necessary training, guidance, supervision, resources, and feedback to perform their responsibilities effectively. The RBT Supervisor works collaboratively with the Clinical Leadership Team, Human Resources, and Operations to maintain a qualified, engaged, and high-performing RBT workforce. The Supervisor supports administrative responsibilities as they relate to the role of the RBTs including but not limited to: scheduling, creating resources, identifying and rectifying process gaps, time keeping, certification compliance, client coverage in the event of call-outs, and staff engagement initiatives.</span></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Bachelor's degree from an accredited college in a related field of study preferred. </span></li></ul><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-3794-AE6B-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000006-1740-290A-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-1740-290A-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Active Registered Behavioral Tech certification &nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000006-6C71-22A2-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-6C71-22A2-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience working in an ABA, behavioral health, healthcare, or human services environment.</span></li><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Knowledge of RBT responsibilities, BACB requirements, and ethical standards.</span></li><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Familiarity with employee onboarding, performance management, and workforce development.</span></li><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Proficiency in electronic documentation, scheduling platforms, and Microsoft Office or similar software.</span></li><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Previous experience supervising, training, coaching, or managing employees preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000006-7E4E-8C34-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" id=\"x_x_x_x_x_x_x_x_{00000001-7E4E-8C34-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday.</span></li><li class=\"x_xxxxxxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Occasional evenings as needed. </span></li></ul><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p class=\"x_xxxxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=shareb